+ }
+ 
++/* read_reg/write_reg 的第三个返回值：这个寄存器该由宿主回答。它们拿不到
++   insn/pc，所以把"交给宿主"这件事讲给外层，由外层组装退出。 */
++#define HV_SYSREG_EXTERNAL (-2)
++
++/* The ID / cache-description group: op0=3, CRn=0, no matter the op1/crm/op2.
++   Everything a CPU model declares *about itself* lives there -- MIDR, MPIDR,
++   REVIDR, the whole ID_AA64* set, CTR_EL0, DCZID, CLIDR, AIDR, CCSIDR and the
++   CSSELR that selects which CCSIDR is being asked about.
++
++   Under a host that owns the CPU model these are the host's to answer.  Three
++   separate problems turn out to be the same problem, which is why this is one
